092157765000000
081128ALLY ASSOCIATED WITH THE KOEHN LEASE AND COMPLETED/PERMITTED IN A DEEPF0000000000
092157765000000
081228ER FORMATION. THE WELL WAS LATER PLUGGED BACK AND PERMITTED FOR INJECTF0000000000
092157765000000
081328ION INTO THE SAN ANDRES. THE RRC UIC DEPARTMENT HAS NOW REQUESTED THATF0000000000
092157765000000
081428 OUR CLIENT RECLASSIFY THE WELL FROM INJECTION/SERVICE STATUS TO A SHUF0000000000
092157765000000
081528T-IN PRODUCER. WE ARE NOT PROPOSING TO DRILL A NEW WELL, MOVE THE WELLF0000000000
092157765000000
